262 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The Sri Lankan civil war has left smaller communities with heightened poverty rates and socioeconomic struggles, resulting in limited access to healthcare. In the small Tamil town of Nawalapitiya, located in Kandy District, 33% of the population suffers from cataracts. Cataracts are a condition of cloudiness in the lens of the eye, resulting in a drastic decline in visual function. This condition has been associated with diminished quality of life and even increased physical injury/mortality rates among the elderly. Even though cataract surgery is remarkably safe \(98% )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
