>>
endobj
528 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/T (The lasting effects of the Sri Lankan civil conflict have left Nawalapitiya, a small suburban town in Kandy District, Sri Lanka, with challenges of limited healthcare access and heightened poverty rates. The community struggles with eye health, particularly with regard to cataracts.)
/E (The lasting effects of the Sri Lankan civil conflict have left Nawalapitiya, a small suburban town in Kandy District, Sri Lanka, with challenges of limited healthcare access and heightened poverty rates. The community struggles with eye health, particularly with regard to cataracts.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
529 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/T (Cataract remains the leading cause of blindness. The National Eye Institute describes cataracts as cloudy areas in the lens of the eye that significantly affect day-to-day life. Examples include limitations in mobility, activities of daily living, and physical performance. Blindness and visual impairment are not only health issues for the elderly but also significantly affect the quality of their lives.)
/E (Cataract remains the leading cause of blindness. The National Eye Institute describes cataracts as cloudy areas in the lens of the eye that significantly affect day-to-day life. Examples include limitations in mobility, activities of daily living, and physical performance. Blindness and visual impairment are not only health issues for the elderly but also significantly affect the quality of their lives.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
530 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/T (In Kandy District, an estimated 33% of people experience impaired vision from complications of cataracts. In a National Library of Medicine \(NLM\) paper, researchers found that out of 470 elders \(people over the age of 60\), 379 \(or 80.6%\) were found to have some kind of cataract. This study demonstrated lack of awareness and knowledge, socioeconomic factors, and misconceptions as the main barriers to cataract treatment, leading to a lower cataract surgery rate irrespective of the high cataract prevalence reported. Findings of this study highlight the importance of cataracts as a common health problem in the elderly and recommend eliminating barriers to its treatment - i However, it is reported that 67% of Kandy district cataract patients cannot afford treatment. )
/E (In Kandy District, an estimated 33% of people experience impaired vision from complications of cataracts. In a National Library of Medicine \(NLM\) paper, researchers found that out of 470 elders \(people over the age of 60\), 379 \(or 80.6%\) were found to have some kind of cataract. This study demonstrated lack of awareness and knowledge, socioeconomic factors, and misconceptions as the main barriers to cataract treatment, leading to a lower cataract surgery rate irrespective of the high cataract prevalence reported. Findings of this study highlight the importance of cataracts as a common health problem in the elderly and recommend eliminating barriers to its treatment - i However, it is reported that 67% of Kandy district cataract patients cannot afford treatment. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
