545 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Cataracts are curable, but only with cataract eye surgery. This surgery is safe and effective, helping 98% of people with no complications. Unfortunately, the price of cataract eye surgery is simply unaffordable for Nawalapitiya residents. With Parvaiyattam, we aim to make a difference in the community by making better cataract surgery treatments available and helping those affected regain their vision to lead happier, healthier lives.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [24]
>>
endobj
