550 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (This project aimed to deliver funds to the Nawalapitiya community to provide cataract surgical sets for those affected by the condition. Towards this, we created a fundraising project by partnering with WSSTA - the Washington State Sri Lankan Tamil Association - to put together two performances of Bharatanatyam, a Tamil cultural dance, in an event called Parvaiyattam \(Dancing for Sight\). Our goals were 1\) to raise funds by selling tickets for the event and encouraging donations from attendees for the Nawalapitiya General Hospital and 2\) to create awareness about the healthcare inequalities in Sri Lanka. The project comprised the planning and logistics for the event, campaigns through organic and social media reach, performance, and delivery of funds to provide access to eye care for the community. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
