586 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Parvaiyattam focused on raising funds \(goal: $10,000\) for the Nawalapitiya General Hospital in collaboration with WSSTA. With these funds, 187 cataract surgery equipment sets could be distributed. Cataract surgery can last as little as 10 minutes, but the benefits are worthwhile for a lifetime of clear vision. It allows people to reconnect visually, socially, and emotionally with their loved ones, improving their quality of life. It also significantly reduces the chance of severe physical injury in elders, reducing future treatment costs. By making cataract surgery a possibility for the people of Nawalapitiya, we can lead them to a brighter and more sustainable future.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
587 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
