/T (Rationale)
/E (Rationale)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
588 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Tamils are an ethno-linguistic group located in South Asia. Hearing about the devastating plight of Tamils in Sri Lanka following their Civil War, we reached out to the Washington State Sri Lankan Tamil Association \(WSSTA\) to understand more about the issue and how we could help. We learned about the limited access to healthcare and how it disproportionately affects small communities. Higher costs are associated with acquiring healthcare necessities and procedures for those in rural areas, as there is high demand in contrast to limited access. Unfortunately, rural/small-town populations cannot afford treatment, even for relatively simple concerns, such as cataracts.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
