/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T (                  The primary goal of the Parvaiyattam project was to raise enough money to help alleviate the costs associated with 187 cataract surgeries in Nawalapitiya, given the calculated cost of a set of one-time use surgical equipment is $53.31 \(USD\). The breakdown of this cost is as follows: $2.17 for a phaco knife \(used for clear corneal incision  \(CCI\), near corneal incisions and scleral tunnel  incisions in cataract surgery\), $4.65 for vision  blue dye \(a sterile solution used for medical aid\),  $9.30 for methyl cellulose \(used to relieve dry,  irritated eyes\), and $37.19 for a pair of lenses to finish the cataract surgery.)
/E (                  The primary goal of the Parvaiyattam project was to raise enough money to help alleviate the costs associated with 187 cataract surgeries in Nawalapitiya, given the calculated cost of a set of one-time use surgical equipment is $53.31 \(USD\). The breakdown of this cost is as follows: $2.17 for a phaco knife \(used for clear corneal incision  \(CCI\), near corneal incisions and scleral tunnel  incisions in cataract surgery\), $4.65 for vision  blue dye \(a sterile solution used for medical aid\),  $9.30 for methyl cellulose \(used to relieve dry,  irritated eyes\), and $37.19 for a pair of lenses to finish the cataract surgery.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [0 1]
>>
