616 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T (                 The secondary objective was to raise awareness about the limited healthcare access in Nawalapitiya and their struggles with cataract-related vision impairment. We did this by opening the Parvaiyattam event with a speech from the WSSTA president about the issues that Sri Lanka is facing due to civil conflict, specifically regarding to healthcare inequalities in smaller cities. This topic was the main focus of the event, with detailed posters put in place to explain the  problem and demonstrate the impact of any donations on the lives of those in  Nawalapitiya. By raising community awareness, especially within the South Asian  community, we can impart positive change to Nawalapitiya and help countless  people see the world better.)
/E (                 The secondary objective was to raise awareness about the limited healthcare access in Nawalapitiya and their struggles with cataract-related vision impairment. We did this by opening the Parvaiyattam event with a speech from the WSSTA president about the issues that Sri Lanka is facing due to civil conflict, specifically regarding to healthcare inequalities in smaller cities. This topic was the main focus of the event, with detailed posters put in place to explain the  problem and demonstrate the impact of any donations on the lives of those in  Nawalapitiya. By raising community awareness, especially within the South Asian  community, we can impart positive change to Nawalapitiya and help countless  people see the world better.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
