/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Description: The first milestone of the project comprises the following activities: contacting WSSTA to initiate collaboration and confirm project feasibility, coordinating with the Nrityalaya School of Dance dancers, reaching out to the musicians, and assessing the venue - leading to identifying and reserving the Renton IKEA Performing Arts Center. During this phase, we also defined our goals for the project, identified resources, and prepared a high-level schedule. This milestone marks the completion of the initial stages of the project. Once we received confirmation from the involved organizations, we were able to begin preparations for the Parvaiyattam event.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
