<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Description: With the musical arrangements in place, rehearsals for the Bharatanatyam production commenced. We formed a team of dancers and recruited musicians to help prepare for the performance. This included separate dance and music rehearsals, with dress rehearsals leading to the event date. Dance rehearsals were at Nrityalaya School of Dance in Redmond, WA, and musician rehearsals were at their residences in Chennai, India. Dance practices were planned to be intense for at least 15 hours a week in the 2 months leading up to the performance.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
