>>
endobj
685 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T (Description: The Parvaiyattam event was planned for Saturday, December 9th  at the Renton IKEA Performing Arts Center, and consisted of two complete productions: the first from 3:00 pm to 6:30 pm, and the second from 7:00 pm to 10:30 pm. This was done to maximize contributors' attendance and optimize our total funds raised. Both productions were held on the same day to minimize venue rental costs. Each paying attendee contributed $20 in ticket sales, while children under 10 were admitted free of cost. Throughout the event, we invited speakers from WSSTA to speak about Tamils in Sri Lanka and the limited access to healthcare in rural areas, helping us achieve our secondary goal of raising awareness for our cause. )
/E (Description: The Parvaiyattam event was planned for Saturday, December 9th  at the Renton IKEA Performing Arts Center, and consisted of two complete productions: the first from 3:00 pm to 6:30 pm, and the second from 7:00 pm to 10:30 pm. This was done to maximize contributors' attendance and optimize our total funds raised. Both productions were held on the same day to minimize venue rental costs. Each paying attendee contributed $20 in ticket sales, while children under 10 were admitted free of cost. Throughout the event, we invited speakers from WSSTA to speak about Tamils in Sri Lanka and the limited access to healthcare in rural areas, helping us achieve our secondary goal of raising awareness for our cause. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
