/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (WSSTA agreed to cover a maximum of $4,000.00 for the costs associated with the program. Being mindful of their contribution, we wanted to minimize our costs and take advantage of donations. Nrityalaya School of Dance provided production decorations, most of which were recycled from prior events. Additionally, we were able to secure microphones and audio equipment free of cost from the Renton IKEA Performing Arts Center. Altogether, we projected a budget of $1,805.00 for the Parvaiyattam event.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [45]
