/ActualText (This performance is a fundraiser for the Washington State Sri Lanka Tamil Association, which is working towards sponsoring cataract surgery for those whose vision is struggling but cannot afford treatment. To learn more about the purpose and projects of WSSTA, visit their website: www.washingtontamil.org. To donate, you can PayPal at @wssta, or use the email treasurer@washingtontamil.org)
