/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T (Saanvi chose to sell tickets for the event through the platform Sulekha, an online platform dedicated to South Asian community events. She thought it would be a perfect platform for Parvaiyattam and another channel by which we could advertise the event. Sulekha also does not charge a commission fee, so no operating costs were associated with the platform, another driving factor contributing to our choice. We also offered the opportunity to purchase tickets at the door.)
/E (Saanvi chose to sell tickets for the event through the platform Sulekha, an online platform dedicated to South Asian community events. She thought it would be a perfect platform for Parvaiyattam and another channel by which we could advertise the event. Sulekha also does not charge a commission fee, so no operating costs were associated with the platform, another driving factor contributing to our choice. We also offered the opportunity to purchase tickets at the door.)
