/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Luckily, we found the Microsoft Matching opportunity after the event but before transferring the funds we raised. However, with this knowledge, our recommendation would be to research existing community programs to take advantage of them in order to maximize impact for future projects. We can also look for other community programs to identify areas where our goals align with theirs, and also establish partnerships with relevant organizations to reach a broader audience.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [6]
